    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Owl Lights is a first-person psychological horror game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as 16-year-old Paul, who lives in the small town of Windville, where rumors about a cult are beginning to spread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your parents have gone out of town, leaving you to spend the night alone-or so you think. What was supposed to be a pleasant night at home quickly takes a twisted turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The neighborhood feels unusually quiet this evening, as if something is about to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only way to contact your parents-your phone suddenly loses signal, leaving you isolated as you face a night filled with twisted, surreal terrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful, haunting environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul>",
